2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] Rain occurs when moisture in the atmosphere condenses into water droplets that become heavy enough
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] to fall to the ground. This typically happens under conditions like:
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] - Cooling air: When warm, moist air rises and cools (e.g., due to convection, frontal
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] systems, or topography like mountains).
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] - Low pressure systems: Often associated with clouds and precipitation.
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] - Humidity: High moisture content in the air increases the likelihood.
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] Rain can happen seasonally (e.g., monsoons), sporadically (e.g., thunderstorms), or persistently
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] (e.g., in climates with frequent precipitation). Local weather forecasts provide the most accurate
2025-08-23 11:12:35 [deepseek-chat] predictions!
