2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] • GitHub Pages*:
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] - Static website hosting service
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] - Publishes content from a branch (often `gh-pages`) or specific folder
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] - Custom domain support
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] - Used for project websites, portfolios, documentation sites
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] - Accessed via dedicated URL (`username.github.io/repo`)
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] While both use Markdown, Pages creates public-facing websites, while Wikis are primarily for
2025-08-23 11:23:51 [deepseek-chat] project documentation.
